flowchart LR
  U[User / Browser] --> S[NodePort or port-forward]
  S --> W[Flask Web Deployment]
  W --> R[Redis Service]
  R --> D[(Redis data)]
  W -. CPU metrics .-> H[HPA]
  H --> W
  W --> C1[Minikube Cluster A\nPrivate-cloud simulation]
  C1 -. Failure / manual switch .-> C2[Minikube Cluster B\nPublic-cloud simulation]
  C2 --> W2[Flask + Redis replica deployment]
